        "created_at": "2019-06-04T12:13:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I felt like I was doing everything magically right at first, blasting Omnitron with fire, skipping AZ's first power so I could grab two module installations with Glacial Structure, using Into the Stratosphere over and over again.</p>\n<p>And then Obisidian Field came out and it all fell apart. c.c This is why I don't play with only three heroes.</p>",
