        "id": 227729,
        "name": "Melkhor",
        "username": "Melkhor",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-04T12:51:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint here with everyone at exactly 20 HP at the end. AZ ate a Singularity to the face with his full setup in play, but with the help of Tempest's constant soothing downpour, he shrugged it off and patiently rebuild over the next several turns. No particular Omni-hijnks to be aware of, though he did manage to squeeze an extra cardplay out of Terraforming by using it to take out the Volcano, which he then wasted by playing a second Terraforming on an empty field.</p>",
