        "id": 227732,
        "name": "The Grim Digger",
        "username": "The_Grim_Digger",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/3e96dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-05T02:16:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Pretty easy Mint with everyone around 16.&nbsp; I got Cleansing Downpour out after Sedative Flechettes had gone off, so Tempest was able to keep everyone topped off on health while Ra and AZ piled on the damage.&nbsp; Ra used Flesh of the Sun God to protect AZ from the downside of Thermal Shockwave until he got his equipment out.&nbsp; There were two Obsidian Fields by the end, so none of Omnitron's components stayed in play for long (aided by Fueled Freeze and Into the Stratosphere).</p>",
