        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e56c9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-05T19:18:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I'm to understand... villain is preprogrammed, but the hero powers basically make them randomized fast (except for Tempest, who has his weakest power and little to do with his draws prior to the 1st Sedative Flechettes)?<br>\n<br>\nSetups like this are really frustrating.</p>",
