        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/a183cd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-05T21:03:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Much easier than I expected. Didn’t use anyone’s &nbsp;base power much. &nbsp;On a redo, I found the thermal shockwave - flesh of the sun god advice above let me win in half the time.</p>\n<p>As far as Tempest variants go, I prefer this one to both prime wardens (powerful but usually I only use the power once in the game) and freedom six (yay, I can skip two turns at the same time if I have nothing I want to play).&nbsp;</p>",
