        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Much easier than I expected. Didn’t use anyone’s &nbsp;base power much. &nbsp;On a redo, I found the thermal shockwave - flesh of the sun god advice above let me win in half the time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As far as Tempest variants go, I prefer this one to both prime wardens (powerful but usually I only use the power once in the game) and freedom six (yay, I can skip two turns at the same time if I have nothing I want to play).&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [
          {
            "id": 2,
            "can_act": true
          },
          {
            "id": 6,
