      {
        "id": 227735,
        "name": "M1rth",
        "username": "M1rth",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e56c9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-05T21:47:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Finally beat it, but had to use Ra's base power several times and accept burning&nbsp;burn cards for a while to keep the various bots and pterodactyls&nbsp;at bay. Flash flood was reserved for making sure the T-rex was only around one round.&nbsp;This is way too random, the moment you touch Ra's summon staffs or AZ's power their decks are shuffled and it's chaos, I simply had better cards available (didn't even GET a flesh of the sun god during one loss) when I finally won.</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
