        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-08T22:12:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I find the diversity of experience here interesting. I guess there were a lot of variables related to Summon Staff, Blaze of Glory, Pilot Light, Onboard Module Installation, and Into the Stratosphere. I never saw Terraforming or the Volcano, and only 2 Components individually and near the end of the game. Omnitron insisted on bringing back Repair Drones as much as he could, which was fine. My team had Ia rough time, but I pulled out a mint, down to the wire at x/0/5.</p>",
